      <bpmn2:documentation id="_7n1ZY6hIEfG7tdXwshgAXw"><![CDATA[Creates the building in SMW/PRM and the matching PLACE node in CROSS (sub-process pniDesign_createPlace). Only reached via the "place not found" gateway branch; on success the flow loops back to find place for address. Sets errorMessage on a handled failure; unhandled exceptions are caught by the boundary error event.]]></bpmn2:documentation>
